{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14050","headline":"奉和第五相公登鄱阳郡城西楼 · 耿湋","name":"奉和第五相公登鄱阳郡城西楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茂德爲邦久，丰貂旧相尊。\n发生传雨露，均养助乾坤。\n晓肆登楼目，春销恋阙魂。\n女墙分吏事，远道启津门。\n湓浦潮声尽，锺陵暮色繁。\n夕阳移梦土，芳草接湘源。\n封内羣甿复，兵间百赋存。\n童牛耕废亩，壕木遶新村。\n野步渔声溢，荒祠鼓舞喧。\n高斋成五字，远岫发孤猨。\n一顾承英达，多荣及子孙。\n家贫仍受赐，身老未酬恩。\n属和瑶华曲，堪将系组纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}